  "description": "When Kubera loses her entire village on her 16th birthday, her salvation comes in the form of the magician, Asha. Together they journey through a world of Gods and Suras, magicians and pure-bloods. Intent on solving the mystery behind her past, Kubera may also hold the key to changing the world. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
